  "description": "That night, I saw a vision that I could not forget. It was a dream where four azure dragons soared to the skies. And when I met eyes with them... To my astonishment, the dragons turned into handsome young men! They had such wonderful voices that you couldn’t forget them after hearing it once, And of course, their looks were perfect! Add to that the charming, energetic aura they exuded, And their excellent dancing! Each of them were so perfect, right down to their singing... Wouldn’t this combination surely be capable of sweeping the entire nation? They shall be known as Gat-Doryeongs!\n\n**Original Webtoon: **  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=732255), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=4386505)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/drama/got-boys/list?title_no=1748)",
